Call-site s.Get("total") in cmd/report with the default ./... (both binaries loaded).
Under Go semantics cmd/report only ever uses the mem Backend: store.ErrClosed and store.ErrNotFound wrapped "get %q: %w".
The tool resolves s.be.Read per program, not per binary, so disk.ErrNoEntry (wired only by cmd/ingest) is expected too as a documented over-approximation; with -p ./cmd/report it disappears (p_changes_candidates).
